 these products are  coming from our office is taking a  number of actions trying to uh shut them  down  while we also simultaneously uh  uh licensed products because  these will just you know hurt the the  illicit market that we're trying to to  establish so i kind of just wanted to  highlight that one  um and that that kind of is where we are  right now um you know there's there's a  lot going on  um we're hiring folks uh routinely so  you know if you're interested in a  career or know someone who might be  please check our website there's a jobs  tab where you can see  opportunities for for careers  and  we are looking forward to launching the  adult use program bolstering up the  cannabinoid hemp program and then also  making the medical cannabis program more  accessible for patients and  practitioners  um just a real quick highlight on that  we did recently release  proposed regulations which would  actually get rid of the registration  requirement for our medical program um  so uh  once someone would be just uh  authorized by their physician to to use  medical cannabis they wouldn't have to  then go to our office and get registered  to get registered excuse me uh just  trying to make it easier to essentially  be a medical cannabis patient  in the in the in the light that an adult  use market is coming and we want to make  sure that that medical market exists  because you know sometimes it does make  sense for someone to use cannabis uh  with a practitioner's oversight getting  that feedback you know they might be  taking other medications they might have  questions about dosing and so there's  there's a lot of  pros to to being in the medical program  even in in the existence of an adult  used market  so thank you you know please check out  our website um and uh email us at any of  the many emails that we have  and uh we will try and be as responsive  as possible and i'm open for some  questions if we have time  thanks very much pat uh unfortunately we  are out of time so to ask pat questions  uh so hopefully you snapped a picture of  all of those contacts there  and i'm sure i know they're very busy at  ocm and pat is incredibly busy but  i'm sure they will get back to you  when time allows so  please join me in thanking pat again  with a round of applause  this has been a production of cornell  university on the web at cornell.edu


